+/*
+ * Adapted for the native-quilt-v1 host compatibility profile (2026).
+ * Loader-engine references are replaced by isolated host-backed/value implementations.
+ * Copyright 2016 FabricMC
+ * Copyright 2022-2023 QuiltMC
